# Headspace size controls pressure
# Expectation: The same acid/carbonate doses should produce higher final pressure over 10 mL than 100 mL sealed headspace.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 10mL
add v1 NaHCO3 0.001mol
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
seal v2 100mL
add v2 NaHCO3 0.001mol
add v2 HCl 0.002mol
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
inspect
